<title>USA: Port of Olympia, Wash., taxable, yields 6.86 pct.</title>
<headline>Port of Olympia, Wash., taxable, yields 6.86 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle-Northwest Securities Corp said it priced $3.350 million of Port of Olympia, Wash., taxable limited tax general obligation bonds, 1996 Series C, with a top yield of 6.86 percent in 2005.</p>
</text>
